title: Hunger
subtitle: The bakeries close, and a district goes hungry.
new-page: true
tags: event
view-if: year = 1923 and month >= 9 and month <= 11 and crisis = 0 and congress = 0 and inflation >= 70
max-visits: 1
on-arrival: {!
var d = RG.target('militancy');
Q.e23_hunger_d = d;
Q.e23_hunger_name = Q.sys_target_name;
Q.e23_hunger_trade = Q.sys_target_trade;
RG.district(d, {militancy: 6});
RG.news('Hunger riots in ' + Q.e23_hunger_name + ': markets plundered', 3);
!}

= Hunger

The dollar costs billions of marks, and the price of a loaf is chalked on the bakery door in the morning and rubbed out at noon. In [+ e23_hunger_name +] the bakers have stopped baking, because flour costs more than they can sell bread for. On Thursday the women came to the market and found the stalls empty, and by evening the shops on the main street had no windows. The farmers will not sell for paper. The police fired over the crowd on Friday.

- @lead: Lead the hungry to the warehouses.
- @kitchens: Open communal kitchens.
- @munzenberg: Ask Münzenberg for his kitchens.

@lead
subtitle: Flour tonight, a strike tomorrow, and the police the day after.
view-if: offensive_gone = 0 or ultraleft_gone = 0
on-arrival: {!
RG.startStrike(Q.e23_hunger_d);
RG.district(Q.e23_hunger_d, {militancy: 10, repression: 10, members: 0.05});
Q.lean_offensive += 2;
!}

The control committees open the grain warehouse at the goods station and hand out flour by the bucket. The works come out the next day for wages in gold.

@kitchens
subtitle: Costs 1 fund. Feeds the district and wins it.
choose-if: resources >= 1
unavailable-subtitle: We have nothing to buy food with.
on-arrival: {!
Q.resources -= 1;
RG.district(Q.e23_hunger_d, {loyalty: 8, members: 0.06, militancy: -2});
Q.lean_unionist += 1;
!}

The party buys potatoes in Czechoslovakia with crowns. Kitchens open in four union halls and a school, and a thousand families eat under a red banner every evening.

@munzenberg
subtitle: The Workers' International Relief remembers who helped with the Volga.
view-if: e22_famine = 1
on-arrival: {!
RG.district(Q.e23_hunger_d, {loyalty: 10, members: 0.08, militancy: -2});
Q.worker_support += 3;
!}

Münzenberg's lorries arrive within the week with flour bought in Holland and soup kettles left over from the Volga. The kitchens carry the name of the International Relief, and the party's speakers stand beside them.
